 "traditions": [],
 "notes": "Kept the single planned kind Pendant light (old k2). 19 archetypes ordered by significance: PH family (old PH models became versions, years from the Henningsen works table), VL45, Nelson Bubble, Flowerpot, Caravaggio, Akari, Random, Beat, Mirror Ball, Big Bang, Caboche, Porca Miseria!, Zettel'z, Castiglioni/Flos (Splüghen Braü, Parentesi, Frisbi), Saliscendi, billiard pendant, paper lantern shade. Dropped: about 30 IKEA SKUs (kept PS 2014, MELODI and three ranges), the 5 Studio Luminosa SKUs, KARE Scala Balls, Foscarini Chouchin/Pli/Rituals/Spokes 2/Troag (kept 5 Foscarini models), duplicate IKEA ranges, and ranges now covered by archetypes (PH lamps, Flos Castiglioni designs, Mirror Ball). Flowerpot has no current-maker version (&Tradition not on a retrieved page); Bubble lamp Vitra/HAY not confirmed, left out. VL45 original year left as the Radiohuset build span. Traditions: none added here (Gifu lantern tradition belongs with Lanterns & flame lamps / Paper lantern). Brands without f were not confirmed."
}